# The engine, checked out at the commit package.json pins (`pnpm run engine`), or linked to a
# local checkout: never committed.
.engine
# Worktrees, agents' logs and throwaway files live inside the project, never beside it:
# `.worktrees/<branch>/` for each tree, `.worktrees/logs/` for logs and scratch files.
/.worktrees
